    "flavor_text": {
      "one_line": "Khraaldurn — wary clan confederation of the glacial mountains; tradition, honor.",
      "one_paragraph": "The Khraaldurn (Dwarf) are a defensive clan confederation people seeded in glacial mountains, tundra hills. They prize tradition, honor, family, lean toward the military sphere, and field heavy_infantry, crossbowmen, pikemen. Outsiders are met as wary; their patrons touch mountains, night, death."
